This directory adapts ratatui-markdown 0.3.6 by langyo
(langyo <langyo.china@gmail.com>).
Authoritative upstream: https://github.com/celestia-island/ratatui-markdown

Source: the crates.io ratatui-markdown 0.3.6 package locked by BitRouter.
Package checksum: e44e5c1fcb6b71a3e639b5218ea181ef42b8b05ae87ba4afdc962b48548079ab
The package's .cargo_vcs_info.json records revision
2609d035c42bb0c7c9b8ebf816c6717d496fb97a with dirty: true; the released
package, rather than a later repository revision, is the source of this copy.
Its Cargo.toml declares MIT OR Apache-2.0 and its LICENSE contains the
Apache License 2.0, reproduced verbatim here. This adaptation uses Apache-2.0.

Adapted files: src/markdown/{parser,types,inline,text,render}.rs and the used
wrapping/rendering tests. Box-drawing values originate in
src/constants/list_prefix.rs; semantic tones use BitRouter's existing theme.

Modifications: replaced terminal types and theme parameters with transcript
Row/Run/Format/Tone, retained only the formatted Markdown path used by
BitRouter, and integrated BitRouter's table fallback and codeframe override.
Runtime hooks, image loading, syntax highlighting, tree and widget machinery,
unused block variants and override fields are omitted. Image text placeholders
remain to preserve the existing no-image-feature output. Quote depth saturates
at u8::MAX instead of overflowing. Source-preserving journal formatting is not
part of this module.
